    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40153" root="نفث" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفْثُ الشَّيْطَانِ</span></b>  <i>Poetry:</i> (K, from a trad.:)
called <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نفث</span> because it is like a thing which a
man spits, or blows, (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَنْفِثُ</span>,) from his mouth,
like incantation. (A 'Obeyd.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذَا مِنْ نَفَثَاتِ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلَانٍ</span> <i>This is of the poetry of such a one.</i> (TA.)

